{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":543006,"username":"Darkwave76","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f1d935/{size}.png","created_at":"2019-12-26T09:07:01.705Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eWhy is not possible?\u003cbr\u003e\nI mean I can cheat it taking my saved game in user directory and copy into main + GD Stash, but really why just not allow it directly?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThat’s really a pity\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2019-12-26T09:07:01.705Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3606,"reads":130,"readers_count":129,"score":18046.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":94315,"topic_slug":"crucible-for-mod-character","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Initiate","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":17824,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":543007,"username":"medea_fleecestealer","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/medea_fleecestealer/{size}/110_2.png","created_at":"2019-12-26T09:12:39.392Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome to the forum.  \u003cimg src=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/images/emoji/twitter/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrim Internals will now allow you to play Grimarillion characters in the Crucible. Whether Glockengerda will add that possibility for other mods we’ll just have to wait and see\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"38773\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/glockengerda/40/22346_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/t/tool-grim-internals/38773\"\u003e[Tool] Grim Internals\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"badge-wrapper  box\" href=\"/c/grimdawn/utilities-and-resources\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category-parent-bg\" style=\"background-color: #F1592A;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category-bg\" style=\"background-color: #BF1E2E;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #FFF\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category clear-badge\" title=\"Community created utilities and resources for Grim Dawn. (Note: New Threads require mod approval.)\"\u003eUtilities and Resources\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cblockquote\u003e\n    Grim Internals \n\n\n\u003ca href=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/t/tool-grim-internals/38773/4203\"\u003eNew version v1.90 (x64) for GD v1.1.5.2 uploaded (14. Dec. 2019)\u003c/a\u003e \n\n\nRequirements: \n\u003ca href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/details.aspx?id=48145\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eVisual C++ Redistributable for Visual Studio 2015\u003c/a\u003e \n\n\nInstallation: \n \nExtract the content of the zip file to your game installation directory \nand run the GrimInternals64.exe. \nIf you have the Steam-Version, then you must first startup Steam and then run my tool. \n \n \nImportant: Steam Cloud Save is not functioning properly when you launch Grim Internals! \nTo prevent possible data loss disable Cl…\n  \u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2019-12-26T09:12:39.392Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":35,"reads":130,"readers_count":129,"score":201.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":94315,"topic_slug":"crucible-for-mod-character","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/t/tool-grim-internals/38773","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"[Tool] Grim Internals (v1.1.9.8 only)","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"Super Moderator","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":108,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":543086,"username":"ASYLUM101","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/asylum101/{size}/22_2.png","created_at":"2019-12-26T14:00:24.047Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eYep, it truly is a disappointment, but the reasoning for it is that crucible itself is a “mod”, at least in the way the game perceives mods. I suppose this way crucible can be optional for multiplayer, and even if you own it you can play with people who do not own it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs medea suggested, there is a way using GI but it only works with grimarillion atm. If there is a massive demand for it, maybe she will add support for other mods?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2019-12-26T14:00:24.047Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":17,"reads":117,"readers_count":116,"score":108.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":94315,"topic_slug":"crucible-for-mod-character","primary_group_name":"Playtester_GrimDawn","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Praetorian","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":7,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":543200,"username":"mamba","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/mamba/{size}/100_2.png","created_at":"2019-12-26T18:42:00.216Z","cooked":"\u003caside class=\"quote no-group\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"94315\" data-full=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f1d935/40.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e Darkwave76:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI mean I can cheat it taking my saved game in user directory and copy into main + GD Stash\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eyou cannot really do that in most cases, as mod specific items and masteries get lost that way, so the only mods this would work for are ones that only change some data from vanilla GD, e.g. increase drop rate or mob density\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2019-12-26T18:42:35.548Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":14,"reads":102,"readers_count":101,"score":95.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":94315,"topic_slug":"crucible-for-mod-character","primary_group_name":"Playtester_GrimDawn","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Praetorian","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":99,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":543362,"username":"Darkwave76","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/f1d935/{size}.png","created_at":"2019-12-27T08:10:07.439Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThx all for the clarifications, actually I’m just using the mod “Smash’N’Grab” that increases density/exp/bag size.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI see that actually it augments also max devotions, but I do not like that and I prefer “vanilla build” (it seems to bit cheaty to me having more devotions).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m also looking at Grimarillion (good it can be supported), but also GrimReborn, Reign of Terror.\u003cbr\u003e\nActually there is so much to experiment that it will be lovely to have crucible supported for those too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHonestly with all those builds that are possible to make, for my playstile having increased exp and drop rate (still be almost impossible to be so lucky to get the item you aim for a build) is almost a must that’s why “Smash’N’Grab” is what made me come back to play this game.\u003cbr\u003e\nBefore it, I never cap any char because the exp rate is terrible after 60ish imo.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2019-12-31T13:16:33.112Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":4,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":79,"reads":92,"readers_count":91,"score":413.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":94315,"topic_slug":"crucible-for-mod-character","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Initiate","title_is_group":false,"reply_to_user":{"username":"mamba","name":"mamba","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/mamba/{size}/100_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":17824,"hidden":false,